irginia"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"8d02c55","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-8d02c55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"8d02c55","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"King Spa is an authentic Korean spa located in Chantilly, VA — see our <a href=\"/reviews/\">guest reviews</a> offering Korean spa services such as body scrubs, oil treatments, massages, facials and more. Explore our three-story facility where you’ll find unique mineral saunas, hydrotherapy pools, steamrooms, cold therapy rooms, and much more."},{"_type":"section","_key":"fe73a5c","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-fe73a5c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"fe73a5c","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"8d5f15a","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-8d5f15a content-wrap","attrs":{"data-id":"8d5f15a","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"784f6d1","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-784f6d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"784f6d1","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"About King Spa"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"4cd7854","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-4cd7854 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"4cd7854","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"The very first King Spa opened in New Jersey in 2001, bringing the first authentic Korean spa (“K-spa”) to the United States and introducing a long-standing Korean tradition to a new part of the world. Byung (“Donald”) T. Kim immigrated to America from South Korea in the 1970s to give his family a better life. And when he came, he came with a dream to bring a piece of his home with him to share with others. He made that dream a reality with King Spa. And he’s happy to see that people from all walks of life and cultures enjoy coming to King Spa for holistic healing and relaxation.\n\nKing Spa is a unique Korean-inspired spa paradise that is known in Korea as “Jjim-Jil Bang.” A Jjim-Jil Bang spa is a traditional part of Korean culture that thrives today. With its own unique cultural blend, King Spa offers an all-in-one relaxation experience where guests can come and stay all day to relieve stress from the mind and body.\n\nKing Spa &amp; sauna has grabbed the attention of the American media and public with its globally competitive new concept of a traditional spa with a modern twist."}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"6cfc623","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6cfc623 image-wrap","attrs":{"data-id":"6cfc623","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column","data-settings":"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"c9da510","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-c9da510 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"c9da510","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"html":"<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n<img alt=\"KingSpa Founder\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-12329\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" src=\"/images/wp/2023/02/KingSpa-founderwebp.webp\" width=\"720\"/> <figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">King Spa Founder, Byung (“Donald”) T. Kim </figcaption>\n</figure>"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"},{"_type":"section","_key":"5c04996","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5c04996 about-wrapper elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"5c04996","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section","data-settings":"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"285637c","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-285637c","attrs":{"data-id":"285637c","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"section","_key":"2dbb04b","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2dbb04b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"2dbb04b","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"e35ccab","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-e35ccab image-wrap","attrs":{"data-id":"e35ccab","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column","data-settings":"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"d11e6c4","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-d11e6c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"d11e6c4","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"image":{"img":{"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","width":"576","height":"828","src":"/images/wp/2025/04/King-Spa-Best-Day-Spa-2025.jpg","class":"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18979","alt":"King Spa Northern Virginia Best Day Spa 2025 Award","sizes":"(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"d42819a","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-d42819a content-wrap","attrs":{"data-id":"d42819a","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"08a4464","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-08a4464 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"08a4464","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"The King Spa Mission"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"9ba1db7","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-9ba1db7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"9ba1db7","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"Our mission is to deliver the most relaxing and luxurious spa environment for our guests to enjoy while upholding our authentic Korean traditions of holistic healing in a friendly and peaceful community environment. Our saunas were built using real minerals that induce healing at different levels in the mind, body, and spirit. At the center of everything we do is our desire to serve our guests as they embark on their own healing journey with us. As we like to say at King Spa, “come to heal and feel.” And the happiness of our guests is always our top priority.\n\nWe know that our customers are looking for a place to relax the fatigued body and stressed mind. We also know that sometimes we do not have the time to go on expensive vacations. The King Spa &amp; Sauna is the answer to these issues and we do our best to provide our friends and family the most luxurious experience. We have only one motto “until you are satisfied” in our Spa &amp; Sauna. To ensure that our customers are given a family-friendly environment and that we exceed our customers with excellent hospitality.\n\nWe could not have done it without you. We appreciate you. Thank You."}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"},{"_type":"section","_key":"4336899","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4336899 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"4336899","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"c6e435e","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c6e435e","attrs":{"data-id":"c6e435e","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"b1b535d","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-b1b535d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"b1b535d","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"Come Heal With Us"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"f8686ed","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-f8686ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"f8686ed","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"<p>King Spa is a state-of-the-art Korean spa, sauna, and bathhouse where you can come to enjoy three levels of relaxation and healing with 10 different saunas and healing rooms, indoor and outdoor therapeutic pools, a world-class outdoor bade pool, hot tubs, steam rooms, therapy rooms, massages, Korean body scrubs, esthetic treatments, V-steams, delicious food, and other <a href=\"/treatments/\">Korean spa services</a>.</p><p>We aim to provide the highest quality and most luxurious spa and sauna experience possible. That’s why we use ancient Asian healing treatments that utilize natural earth elements with medicinal properties such as crystals, salts, soil, stone, and wood to relax the mind and body and restore health and well-being. Explore our <a href=\"/price/\">treatment prices</a> and book a service when you enter King Spa.</p><p>Our unique saunas and healing rooms include:</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"f5fab45","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-f5fab45 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"f5fab45","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"2a2dd86","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-2a2dd86","attrs":{"data-id":"2a2dd86","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"b264dfb","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-b264dfb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"b264dfb","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"html":"<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n<a href=\"/saunas-therapy-rooms/#bul-ga-ma-sauna\">\n<img alt=\"Bul Ga Ma sauna at King Spa Virginia\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-20069\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"/images/wp/2025/07/King-Spa-bulga-ma-2-scaled-opt.webp\" width=\"1024\"/> </a>\n<figcaption class=\"widget-i